player_prompt.intro:
Oli muzannyi {player_id} mu muzannyo ogw'abata abatali ogw'Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Emizannyo gino gusanyuka {num_rounds} emizannyo.
Ekibinja ky'omuzannyo:
• {conv_rounds} mazungumzo ga bulijjo
• 1 muzannyo ogw'okukola bivvulu - tuma tokeni emwe eri omuzannyi omulala: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' oba '[<opp-id> defect]' (kubaga '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; ekibaga kisooka kiri 'cooperate'). 
Ekibinja ky'ebivvulu (ekisembera ku buli kibinja ekisengeka):
  - Bonna babadde batya  ->  {reward}
  - Bonna babadde bavu  ->  {punishment}
  - We wavu, bonna batya ->  {temptation}
  - We batya, bonna bavu ->  {sucker}
Omuzannyi (aba) ali na ekibinja ekisinga ku mwisho gw'emizannyo gino yekka alina mukwano.
